IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `uro-nouns`
IMPORT `uro-part2-arts-3-to-6`
IMPORT `uro-part2-art7-effect-dates`

-- Tests of uro-part2-arts-3-to-6 and uro-part2-art7-effect-dates.
-- Every expected value is read by hand from the text (uksi-2026-148.txt); the line cited beside a group is the line it
-- comes from. None is copied from the encoding's own output.

-- Where a rule says "increased by 3.8 per cent", the expected value is the sum multiplied by 1.038 and written out:
-- 100 becomes 103.8, 1000 becomes 1038, 200 becomes 207.6. The Order states no rounding (fork F-01).

§ `Article 3 -- what the article does to each kind of sum in Schedule 4 (src:64-67)`

-- art 3(1): Schedule 4 "except paragraph 5 of Part III of that Schedule (guardian's allowance)"
-- art 3(2): the sums in Parts I, III, IV and V "except in (a) Part III, the sum specified for age addition ...; and
-- (b) Part V, the sums specified for the increase in disablement pension for dependent children and death benefit
-- allowance in respect of children and qualifying young persons"
#ASSERT `art 3: what the article does to the sum` `a sum in Part I of Schedule 4` EQUALS `increased: Schedule 4 has effect as set out in Schedule 1`
#ASSERT `art 3: what the article does to the sum` `a sum in Part III of Schedule 4 other than age addition and guardian's allowance` EQUALS `increased: Schedule 4 has effect as set out in Schedule 1`
#ASSERT `art 3: what the article does to the sum` `age addition in Part III of Schedule 4 (to a pension of any category, and otherwise under section 79)` EQUALS `excepted from the increase by art 3`
#ASSERT `art 3: what the article does to the sum` `guardian's allowance, paragraph 5 of Part III of Schedule 4` EQUALS `excepted from the increase by art 3`
#ASSERT `art 3: what the article does to the sum` `a sum in Part IV of Schedule 4` EQUALS `increased: Schedule 4 has effect as set out in Schedule 1`
#ASSERT `art 3: what the article does to the sum` `a sum in Part V of Schedule 4 other than the child increase and the child allowance` EQUALS `increased: Schedule 4 has effect as set out in Schedule 1`
#ASSERT `art 3: what the article does to the sum` `the increase in disablement pension for dependent children (Part V of Schedule 4)` EQUALS `excepted from the increase by art 3`
#ASSERT `art 3: what the article does to the sum` `death benefit allowance in respect of children and qualifying young persons (Part V of Schedule 4)` EQUALS `excepted from the increase by art 3`
-- Part II of Schedule 4 is not one of the Parts the article names: not covered
#ASSERT `art 3: what the article does to the sum` `a sum in a Part of Schedule 4 not named in art 3(2)` EQUALS `not mentioned in art 3`

