#ASSERT `art 4(3): the sum after the increase of 3.8 per cent` `a sum payable as part of a Category A or B retirement pension by virtue of an order under section 126A, 63 or 150` 2030 200 EQUALS JUST 207.6
#ASSERT `art 4(3): the sum after the increase of 3.8 per cent` `a sum not described in art 4(3)` 2000 100 EQUALS NOTHING
